  "details": "Often in game public game worlds we notice that the vote to kick doesn´t work at all. Sometimes there are cheaters, so people try to vote kick that person, but as soon as you click the button a notification appears, saying \"Not enough users to start a vote kick\". This happens when there are 5 people in the instance, sometimes 10. It is super annoying to not be able to vote kick cheaters or annoying players, especially if the whole lobby tries to do it.",
